y.<\/p><p><b>2 A:<\/b> Why did you take a <gap id=\"gap_1\"><\/gap> to Mallorca?<\/p><p><b> B:<\/b> Because I hate flying, and I love being on the water.<\/p><p><b>3 A:<\/b> Were some people lost in the mountains?<\/p><p><b> B:<\/b> Yes, but a <gap id=\"gap_2\"><\/gap> saved them. It flew above them in one place and a doctor went down on a rope to help.<\/p><p><b>4 A:<\/b> Traffic is terrible in the city. How does Leo get to school?<\/p><p><b> B:<\/b> He takes the <gap id=\"gap_3\"><\/gap>. There\u2019s no traffic or bad weather there!<\/p><p><b>5 A:<\/b> A few years ago, riding a <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap> was mostly for kids.<\/p><p><b> B:<\/b> I know. But now you can rent an electric one in many cities, and a lot of adults use them.<\/p><p><b>6 A:<\/b> Did all 30 members of the club take a <gap id=\"gap_5\"><\/gap> from Rome to Milan?<\/p><p><b> B:<\/b> Yes, we did. But the traffic was really bad, so the journey was slow.<\/p><p><b>Listen and check your answers.<\/b><\/p><p><audio-player id=\"audio-player_0\"><\/audio-player><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"gap","widthMode":"asLongestWord","longestAlternativeSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}]}]}